<string name="tag_backup_import_summary">The backup contains %1$d tags and %2$d app assignments. The tag list and assignments for matching apps will be replaced. Other app entries will be kept and moved to Default if their old tags no longer exist. Existing pin and whitelist flags are preserved for apps already in Enhanced; new app entries restore these flags from the backup. Freeze states and working mode are not changed.</string>
