<string name="full_backup_import_title">Restore Hail app backup?</string>
<string name="full_backup_import_summary">The archive contains %1$d tags, %2$d tracked apps, %3$d app files and %4$d restorable preferences (schema v%5$d). Tracked apps, tags and matching preferences will be replaced with the saved values; archived app files will be merged. Working mode, biometric login and auto-freeze activation are reset. Android permissions, Shizuku/Dhizuku grants, device-owner status, shortcuts pinned by the launcher, queued delayed freeze/unfreeze jobs and actual freeze states are not included. Reconfigure permissions and working mode after restore. Files not present in the archive are kept. The ZIP is not encrypted; store it privately.</string>
<string name="full_backup_import_confirm">Restore backup</string>
<string name="full_backup_import_success">Full backup restored. Reconfigure working mode and required permissions.</string>
